# Overleaf-compatible LaTeX image
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# "Overleaf-compatible" here means: a FULL TeX Live installation pinned to the
# same TeX Live year that Overleaf runs, so that local builds closely match the
# output you would get on Overleaf.
#
# The official texlive/texlive images use the full scheme, so abntex2, fontspec
# and the Portuguese hyphenation patterns are already included -- no tlmgr
# install step is needed (unlike the custom abnt image in ./Dockerfile).
#
# The '-historic' tags are frozen snapshots, which gives reproducible builds.
# Adjust the year below to match the TeX Live version Overleaf is currently
# using (e.g. TL2023-historic, TL2024-historic, ...).
FROM texlive/texlive:TL2024-historic
